cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HE-Austenite: an open dataset of hydrogen embrittlement in austenitic stainless steels tested in hydrogen gas"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  113 records of hydrogen embrittlement in austenitic stainless steels in which
  hydrogen was introduced as a gas, extracted by hand from the tables of nine
  published sources dated 1983 to 2024. The weld zone is recorded for every
  record, and zone is cross-tabulated against alloy family so that the two can
  be separated. Electrochemically charged studies are excluded. Released with
  the extraction schema, the validation and cleaning code, and the figure code.
  Version 0.2 adds the published composition of the heat, weld deposit or filler
  tested in each record, together with a nickel equivalent recomputed on a single
  expression and Angel Md30.
authors:
