repository-code: "https://github.com/mfaizansworkspace-ai/Hydrogen-Embrittlement-in-Austenitic-SS"
keywords:
  - hydrogen embrittlement
  - austenitic stainless steel
  - weld metal
  - delta ferrite
  - gaseous hydrogen
  - relative reduction of area
  - literature-extracted dataset
